  "body": "## Changelog\n\n## 🐛 Fixes\n- cc4ea57 Avoid reflectiva warning when running on Java 25+, closes #36\n\n## 🛠  Build\n- ec9618a Update GH workflow configuration\n- c501361 Update dependencies\n- b1b2320 Update GH workflows\n- 9d2ed39 Update to Maven 3.9.12\n- 47f0894 Update license headers\n- 895a0f0 Bump Gradle to 8.14.3\n- efcb947 Fix license header formatting\n\n## ⚙️  Dependencies\n- 525cee7 Update picocli to 4.7.7\n- b56f5b3 Update slf4j to 2.0.17\n- e425f5a Update Guava 33.2.0 to 33.4.8, closes #33\n\n---\n- d258c44 Releasing version 1.15.0\n- 8983afb Bump for next development cycle\n- f3634d5 Next version 1.15.0-SNAPSHOT\n\n\n## Contributors\nWe'd like to thank the following people for their contributions:\n- Andres Almiray ([@aalmiray](https://github.com/aalmiray))\n- Thomas Vitale ([@ThomasVitale](https://github.com/ThomasVitale))"
